    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Progress Bar\r\n**Goal:** Use a **for loop** to fill the bar from 0% to 100% in 10% increments, with a short pause between each step so it animates.\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n1. Reset the bar, then loop from 10 to 100 counting by 10.\r\n2. Use the loop variable to set the bar's width each step.\r\n3. Use `setTimeout()` to stagger the steps so the fill animates over time.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>Need help? Ask the AI Tutor.</summary>\r\n  \t<ol>\r\n      \t<li>\"How can I use a for loop to fill the bar in 10% steps?\"</li>\r\n  \t\t<li>\"How does setTimeout make the bar move gradually?\"</li>\r\n  \t\t<li>\"What does the loop variable control here?\"</li>\r\n    </ol>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n",
